        "The source case includes NRB, L/min, mm Hg, and ETA. Decode them as a nonrebreathing mask, liters per minute, millimeters of mercury, and estimated time of arrival. The device, its setting, the measured pressure, and the arrival time answer four different questions the hospital needs answered."
